hello my name is Philip and this is  let's talk religion I'm a graduate  student in the academic field of  comparative religion currently working  on my master's thesis about West African  Sufism and in fact I have specialized  primarily in Sufism and an Islam  generally and on this channel I'll be  uploading educational as well as  hopefully entertaining videos about  everything related to the subject so  there will be short videos about basic  concepts like religion itself God  theology politics and so on there will  be more in-depth historical reviews  about certain historical figures or  individuals like the ones already  uploaded on open to fail or even hundun  for example and there'll also be some  longer really cool documentaries about  certain local religious groups the  subject of religion has become an  increasingly important aspect of our  social and political debates but in  spite of this not a lot of people know  too much about it and the complexities  that are part of it and so the aim of  this channel is to at least for some of  you illuminate some of those  complexities and give you a greater  understanding and grasp of the subject  of religion and the way it affects  society and in general and to do this  from an academic perspective so feel  free to subscribe and check out the rest  of the channel and hopefully I'll see  you in a future video thank you  [Music]
 

